  "solution": "def is_array_sorted(arr: list[int]) -> bool:\n    return all(arr[i] <= arr[i + 1] for i in range(len(arr) - 1))\n",
  "explanation": "Adjacent element comparison verifies sorted monotonicity in O(N) time."
